WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Choose the page from the sidebar
From the sidebar choose “Employees & permissions”, then open the “Employees & permissions” tab.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Open Employees
Go to Employees & permissions with an account that has management permission.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Add team members
Add the employee, set their details and permissions according to their tasks, then save.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Organize teams
Go to Teams, arrange the members and the conversation distribution, and test access with an employee account.
